@gatewayBaseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Scenario 31
### Penalty application fails, then operator retries the failed operation manually

### 31.1 Login as landlord, tenant, and admin
# @name loginLandlord
POST {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2
}

###
# @name loginTenant
POST {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 4
}

###
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 6
}

### 31.2 Create claim with amount < 200 so async assessment skips additional-info
# @name createClaim
POST {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/claims
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginLandlord.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "tenantUserId": 4,
  "title": "Dining chair leg snapped",
  "description": "Simple penalty flow for failure and recovery demo.",
  "claimedAmount": 120.00,
  "currency": "USD"
}

### 31.3 Poll claim until status becomes AWAITING_TENANT_RESPONSE
GET {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/claims/{{createClaim.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginLandlord.response.body.$.token}}

### 31.4 Tenant responds
POST {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/claims/{{createClaim.response.body.$.id}}/tenant-response
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginTenant.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "agree": false,
  "comment": "I disagree and want support review."
}

### 31.5 Support decision requests penalty but simulates downstream failure
POST {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/claims/{{createClaim.response.body.$.id}}/support-decision
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "applyPenalty": true,
  "penaltyAmount": 84.00,
  "penaltyCurrency": "USD",
  "note": "Simulate failed external processor",
  "simulateFailure": true
}

### 31.6 Poll claim until status becomes PENALTY_PROCESSING_FAILED
GET {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/claims/{{createClaim.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.token}}

### 31.7 Inspect failed penalty operation
# @name failedOps
GET {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/penalties/claims/{{createClaim.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.token}}

### 31.8 Retry the latest failed operation manually
POST {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/penalties/operations/{{failedOps.response.body.$[0].id}}/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.token}}

### 31.9 Poll claim until status becomes PENALTY_APPLIED
GET {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/claims/{{createClaim.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.token}}

### 31.10 Inspect audit trail
GET {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/api/audit/claims/{{createClaim.response.body.$.id}}/events
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.token}}
